v1.1.0 (2026-08-07)
- Add OMDb as a rating source (IMDb rating via OMDb API, vote count fixed to 1)
- Add TMDB as a fallback source for TV episodes that OMDb has no rating for
- OMDb and TMDB API keys are now configured by the user in the addon settings
- Disable IMDb scraping entry point (IMDb blocks scripted requests with AWS WAF)
- Improved multi-source resilience: a failing source no longer affects others
- Add unit tests for OMDb source and multi-source failure handling

v1.0.2 (2025-01-08)
- Maintenance fixes

v1.0.1 (2025-01-08)
- Minor fixes

v1.0.0 (2025-01-08)
- Initial release
- Automatic rating updates for movies and TV shows
- Support for IMDb and Trakt as rating sources
- Weighted average calculation when multiple sources are enabled
- Configurable update interval (in days)
- Year-based filter for movies
- Air date filter for TV shows
- Built-in log viewer for rating updates
- Rate limiting for API calls
- Detailed logging system
